    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="eba0179e-02a4-509c-ab97-21011ff8c358" activityNameId="0d02f356-45a9-5238-9f82-297bfdc3c7fe" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, scooter</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, scooter
Data derived from average data for motorcycle operation in Europe in the year 2010. HBEFA data extrapolated to 3.5 lt/100km fuel consumption.;
UUID: 22ccc063-ef92-343f-9524-ec73b53ecfa3
Dataset for operation of a scooter with a 50cc motor. Fuel consumption for two-stroke petrol included. Direct airborne emissions of gaseous substances and particulates matter according to HBEFA (2004) for motorcycles (with catalyst). Heavy metal emissions caused by tyre wear extrapolated from average passenger car emissions.
Location: Data refers to Swiss Conditions
Technology: average values for Swiss 50cc-150cc fleet: two-stroke: 45%, four-stroke: 55%
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: some data extrapolated from passenger car emissions
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_22ccc063-ef92-343f-9524-ec73b53ecfa3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
